rom 82 at the end of 2007 to 118 by June 30, 2010, with staff in Wuhan, Beijing, Shenzhen, Chengdu, and Shanghai, and established a Shanghai branch in July 2009. Its prospectus describes semiconductor device sales revenue, regional distribution, and sales models from 2007 to the first half of 2010, along with industry characteristics such as technical strength, distribution models, and regional patterns. The company plans to expand supplier scale, product variety, customer base, and sales revenue through fundraising projects."}
