y terms.\n\nThe second entity is Wuhan Liyuan Information Technology Co., Ltd. (武汉力源信息技术股份有限公司), which also issued a 招股意向书 as its IPO prospectus. This document contains sections on the controlling shareholder, major financial data, and financial indicators, and discloses various risks including those related to the company's restructuring and establishment and risks of control by the actual controller. It presents shareholding and organizational structures as of its signing date and includes information about the company's shareholders, actual controller, and related-party transactions. The prospectus also contains competitive analysis of the issuer's main business, disclosures about land use rights and trademarks, and information about leases, core technologies, and other matters."}
