loped software and logic circuits. Its products are primarily used in national defense command information systems and military applications, with a small amount extending to civil communication fields such as prisons, oil fields, municipal construction, and financial business sectors. The company is involved in the national defense and military equipment industry and operates in the national defense informationization sector.\n\nThe company's revenues and profits are highly concentrated in military clients, and it is subject to related risks. It sells products to military customers and integrators, and participates in military networked video command systems. Its accounts receivable, asset impairment losses, and seasonal revenue fluctuations are disclosed in the report, with long collection cycles and low accounts receivable turnover. The company follows a make-to-order production model, pays advance payments per contract terms, arranges production tasks accordingly, and self-produces core equipment. Its prospectus also discusses the development history of computer communication technology."}
