{"entity": "程家明", "type": "person", "description": "程家明 is a Chinese national, born in June 1969, who serves as Chairman and General Manager of Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd. (武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司), a position he has held continuously for over two years. He graduated from National University of Defense Technology with an undergraduate degree in Information Processing Display and Recognition, and is listed among the company's core technical personnel. He is married to 黄敏 and is a cousin of 陈爱民, with whom he co-founded Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.\n\nAs the controlling shareholder and actual controller of Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd., 程家明 directly holds 28,862,900 shares, representing 52.29% of the company before issuance (39.22% after), and indirectly controls 19.28% through Xingtu Investment (兴图投资), for total control of 71.57%. At the time of the company's establishment, he contributed 131,900 yuan in cash and 218,100 yuan in kind, holding 70.50% of shares at conversion. Following a January 2017 capital change, he held 31,266,400 shares, a 62.33% stake; this later changed to 31,266,400 shares (59.84%) after a capital increase. He later transferred 2,403,500 shares to 汇智蓝健 at 11.48 yuan per share for a total of 27.6 million yuan. He was also a party to investment agreements with 光谷人才创投 and 广垦太证. In 2018, his total remuneration was 374,700 yuan, received full-time at the company.\n\n程家明 also exercises control over multiple affiliated enterprises. He holds 84.00% of 武汉智慧易视科技有限公司 and 55.00% of 武汉亲情互联科技有限公司, and controls 兴图投资, 北京智慧易视, 亲情互联, and 耆爱之家, among others. He serves as executive director of Xingtu Investment (the employee stock ownership platform), executive director and general manager of Wuhan Qimu (武汉启目科技有限公司, a wholly-owned subsidiary), executive director and general manager of Beijing Qimu (北京启目科技有限公司, a second-level wholly-owned subsidiary), and executive director of Wuhan Zhihui Yishi and Beijing Zhihui Yishi. He is also the legal representative of Wuhan Qimu and Beijing Qimu.\n\nIn the issuer's earlier history, when its predecessor was established in June 2004, 程家明 contributed office computers and a Midea central air conditioner as capital. He was authorized to handle the assets of 兴图电子, with all of its fixed and current assets transferred to his ownership and disposal, and he was entrusted by 李群英 to handle 兴图电子's deregistration. Notably, the issuer and 程家明 have been unable to contact 李群英, a shareholder who held 30% of 兴图电子 before its deregistration. On June 21, 2017, he was elected as director of the third board of directors of Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd. and elected as chairman on the same day, and was appointed as General Manager on the same date."}
