{"entity": "招股意向书", "type": "content", "description": "招股意向书 is a formal document type used in initial public offerings (IPOs) in China, functioning as a letter of intent or prospectus submitted by a company in connection with its public offering and listing. The descriptions provided refer to two distinct entities that share this document type.\n\nThe first entity is Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd. (武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司), which issued its 招股意向书 in connection with its IPO and listing on the STAR Market. This prospectus serves as the formal submission filing and discloses comprehensive information about the issuer, including basic company information, business operations, main products, business model, research and development model, production processes, core technologies, and development history, as well as industry competitive position. It covers issuance details, important commitments, and fundraising plans. Financial information includes financial data, accounts receivable aging tables, dividend distribution policies, and sensitivity analysis tables. The document also addresses investor protection measures, executive changes, shareholdings, external investments, equity incentives, employee headcount, and social security matters, and identifies related companies such as 兴图天建, 武汉启目, 北京启目, and 华创兴图. Regarding governance, it provides information on senior management and core technical personnel as of the signing date, discloses changes in directors, supervisors, and senior management over the preceding two years, and confirms that shares held by directors, supervisors, senior management, and core technical personnel were not pledged or frozen. It further contains information on related-party transactions, order acquisition and pricing, and procurement activities, and extensively discloses risk factors including risks related to exempted or declassified disclosure of classified information, offering failure, and other unforeseen risks, along with definitions of key terms.\n\nThe second entity is Wuhan Liyuan Information Technology Co., Ltd. (武汉力源信息技术股份有限公司), which also issued a 招股意向书 as its IPO prospectus. This document contains sections on the controlling shareholder, major financial data, and financial indicators, and discloses various risks including those related to the company's restructuring and establishment and risks of control by the actual controller. It presents shareholding and organizational structures as of its signing date and includes information about the company's shareholders, actual controller, and related-party transactions. The prospectus also contains competitive analysis of the issuer's main business, disclosures about land use rights and trademarks, and information about leases, core technologies, and other matters."}
{"entity": "兴图投资", "type": "organization", "description": "兴图投资，全称武汉兴图投资有限公司，成立于2012年12月21日，法定代表人为程家明，注册资本为1,204.00万元。该公司是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司（简称“兴图新科”）的股东，也是一家员工持股平台，程家明担任执行董事。兴图投资除持有兴图新科股份外，没有其他业务经营。\n\n在持股情况方面，兴图投资在兴图新科本次发行前持有19.28%的股权，为第二大股东。2017年1月资本变更后，其持有兴图新科10,640,000股股份，持股比例为21.21%；另有资料显示其持有10,640,000股，占比20.36%，以及本次发行前持有10,640,000股，占比19.28%。程家明通过兴图投资间接控制兴图新科19.28%的股权。此外，程家明控制兴图投资，并与兴图投资共同作为兴图新科的股东，合计持有兴图新科55.85%股权，其中程家明本人持有兴图投资55.85%的份额。兴图投资作为员工持股平台，众多董事、监事、高级管理人员及核心技术人员通过其间接持有兴图新科股份，并存在相应的员工持股情况及会计处理。"}
