{"entity": "力源信息", "type": "organization", "description": "力源信息 is the shorthand name for Wuhan P&S Information Technology Co., Ltd. (武汉力源信息技术股份有限公司), a Chinese IC distributor and catalog distributor of electronic products. The company primarily targets the domestic small and medium batch procurement market, serving small and medium-sized enterprises as well as electronic engineers, and is known for aiming to close the gap with Digi-Key. It holds 100% equity in Hong Kong Liyuan (香港力源). Its sales model combines catalog sales, online and telephone sales, key account sales, and channel sales, supported by cooperation retail outlets, value-added agents, and major customer sales channels. The company promotes and sells IC chips mainly to domestic industrial control customers, has over 7,400 active customers, distributes products for 18 well-known semiconductor manufacturers, and offers more than 15,000 product varieties, using reference design solutions to drive sales as a competitive advantage.\n\n力源信息 has high market visibility and brand reputation, having been repeatedly selected as readers' most satisfied IC distributor since 2003 and listed among the most satisfactory distributors by Chinese readers in a 2009 survey. The company also holds various trademarks and has applied to the National Trademark Office to change trademark registrant names and register trademark applications directly under its own name. Rental records list 力源信息 as leasing offices 9088室, 9098室, and 2028/3028/3068室 from 创业服务 for periods spanning 2010 to 2011."}
